      "id": "l1",
      "shot": "lineage",
      "zh": "到了那时，这场始于地球浅海的远征，",
      "en": "By then, this voyage that began in the shallow seas of Earth",
      "start": 1.2,
      "end": 4.728,
      "dur": 3.528
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "shot": "lineage",
      "zh": "早已跨越无数代形体与心智。",
      "en": "will long since have crossed countless generations of body and mind.",
      "start": 5.008,
      "end": 7.317,
      "dur": 2.309
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "shot": "first",
      "zh": "最初出发的生命，无法想象最后的旅人；",
      "en": "The first life to set out could never imagine the last traveler;",
